translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.viewOutposts	View outposts
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.queuedTitle	Waiting for your outpost to come online
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.queuedBody	This session is queued on your outpost and no machine has picked it up yet. This is your organization's own outpost, not a Devin outage — Devin will keep waiting and start as soon as a machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.queuedBody_named	This session is queued on your outpost "{{outpostName}}" and no machine has picked it up yet. This is your organization's own outpost, not a Devin outage — Devin will keep waiting and start as soon as a machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.claimedTitle	Your outpost machine is connecting
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.claimedBody	A worker in your outpost accepted this session and is connecting. Devin is ready and will start as soon as your machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.claimedBody_named	A worker in your outpost "{{outpostName}}" accepted this session and is connecting. Devin is ready and will start as soon as your machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.stalledTitle	Your outpost machine hasn't connected
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.stalledBody	A worker in your outpost accepted this session but hasn't connected in time. Check that your outpost workers are running and healthy — Devin will keep waiting until a machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.stalledBody_named	A worker in your outpost "{{outpostName}}" accepted this session but hasn't connected in time. Check that your outpost workers are running and healthy — Devin will keep waiting until a machine connects.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.failedTitle	Your outpost couldn't start a machine for this session
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.failedBody	A worker in your outpost accepted this session but could not start its machine, so it gave the session up. Fix the cause (for example, make sure the image can be pulled, or rebuild the environment image) and start the session again.
translation.messageHistory.outpostWaiting.failedBody_named	A worker in your outpost "{{outpostName}}" accepted this session but could not start its machine, so it gave the session up. Fix the cause (for example, make sure the image can be pulled, or rebuild the environment image) and start the session again.
